{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "John Meets Sandra", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "What's Happening?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The First Conditional ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The first conditional can be used in the positive form.<br><span class=\"italic\">Example: If I get a high-paying job, I will buy new work clothes.</span> <br><br>The first conditional can also be used in the negative form.<br><span class=\"italic\">Example: If I don't get a high-paying job, I won't buy new work clothes.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "After I pass my test, I will look for a better job. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When I get a high-paying job, I might need to buy new work clothes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Once I start making a lot of money, I will go on a cruise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " You can also use the first conditional starting with <span class=\"italic\">when</span> and <span class=\"italic\">after</span>.<br>You can start the sentence with <span class=\"italic\">when</span>, <span class=\"italic\">after</span> and <span class=\"italic\">once</span> to say what the result will be when you  do something or after you  finish an action.", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I've had it ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "You say this when you've had enough putting up with something difficult or unpleasant.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I've had it with going up and down on a ship.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about your career.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "leave of absence", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period of time away from your regular job ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: John is taking a leave of absence from his job on the ship.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be on board ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to agree with others or to join ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Everyone in the office is on board with the new idea.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tremendous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very large or excellent ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This new job has tremendous benefits for my career.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tourism ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the industry related to travel ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: John doesn't want to stay in the tourism industry on the ship.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "professional development ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " learning related to a career", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The professional development workshop I went to really helped me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "finance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "any area related to money ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter is interested in a career in finance.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "What skills do you hold from your current job? Write a list. <br/> Examples: <span class=\"italic\">I can ... ,  I'm good at ... , I know how to ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partners what they wish to learn for professional development? Write a list of 3-4 suggestions. <br/>  Example: <span class=\"italic\">If there is a professional development workshop, I want to learn about <span class=\"underline\">customer service</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 4 sentences using first conditional. Write about what you can do if you learn something in professional development. <br/>  Example: <span class=\"italic\">If I learn about ________ in professional development, I can ________.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I identify skills from my job. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write sentences about my skills.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write suggestions on professional learning.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about work expressing possibilities.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le07ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le07ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey, John. Welcome home. Nice to be on dry land?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Yeah, I've had it on the waves for a while. Good to see you, Peter.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Did you take a leave of absence?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: A short one. Did you get the job with the investment firm?<br>"}, {"image": "engenn5le07ob03re2img07.jpg", "time": "14000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, not yet! Once I get on board, it holds tremendous potential for my career.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">